          "notes": "CXS 210-1999 Standard for Named Vegetable Oils Sec 5.1 / CXS 19-1981 Edible Fats and Oils Sec 4 set total arsenic 0.1 mg/kg (and lead 0.1 mg/kg) as commodity-standard MLs. Confirmed in force; CCFO29 (2024) directed CCCF to consolidate these As/Pb oil MLs into horizontal CXS 193. Loaded 2026-08-10 (oils not-material audit): closes the As-in-oil no-ML gap so olive-oil/cooking-oils tAs adopt a real ceiling under Method v2.0 rather than being mislabelled not-material.",
